**Vulnerability 6 - Unchecked Asset Receiver**: The contract doesn't handle asset transfers, only payments. ✅

The main security concern is in the payment logic where the receiver address is not validated. While the admin authorization is properly checked, the contract doesn't ensure the funds are sent to the intended recipient.

